# Business or Website Name

> One-sentence verified description of the organization, customers served, and primary market.

## Primary pages

- [Home](https://example.com/): Main business overview.
- [Services](https://example.com/services): Verified services, process, pricing or quote expectations, and contact route.
- [About](https://example.com/about): Ownership, experience, and business identity.
- [Resources](https://example.com/resources): Original guides and decision-support content.
- [Contact](https://example.com/contact): Public contact methods.

## Services

- Verified service one
- Verified service two
- Verified service three

## Service area and delivery

State the truthful service area. If there is no public storefront, say that services are provided remotely or at customer locations by appointment. Do not publish a private address.

## Trust and accuracy

- Use only verified prices, capabilities, examples, qualifications, and policies.
- Do not imply guaranteed rankings, results, reviews, or platform approval.
- Treat the public website pages as the controlling source if this orientation file becomes stale.
